<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: All men are free of other men's goods.</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Anrichter.</hi></head>                <lb/>
