</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Anriechen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Dar rûk an, as Kasper an de Sûrkôl (Sauerkraut).</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oldenburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, II, 536.</hi></p>                <lb/>
