<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Frz.</hi>: De la panse vient la danse. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn, I, 15.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">123 Voller Bauch macht faule Knechte.</hi></p>                <lb/>
