<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Chi vuol bene comandare prima cominci a fare.</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">12 Wer befehlen will, muss kaufen.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Altröm.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
