<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">Gröng<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> Krestmes, wisse Posche<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Aachen.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 493, 79.</hi></p>                <lb/>
