<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Alieno praesidio ferox. (<hi rendition="#i">Binder II, 119; Buchler, 40.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p/>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Christophelgebet.</hi></head>                <lb/>
