<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*7 Enen Krästag moachen.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Siebenbürg.- sächs.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 175, 160.</hi></p>                <lb/>
