<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Holl.</hi>: Och och, ic woon onder die dorne. (<hi rendition="#i">Tunn., 21, 17.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Versor in tribulis spinis multisque coactor. (<hi rendition="#i">Fallersleben, 592.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
