<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*95 Den Dreck in't Hûs fegen.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Hildesheim.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 185, 5.</hi></p>                <lb/>
