<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">397 Wenn de Esel sîn dragt hett<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi>, so wêt he, wo he geit.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Holst.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
