<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">73 Was man in saure (vnsaubere) vass geusst, das saurt bald.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, II, 43<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Tappius, 171<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Petri, II, 603; Lehmann, II, 835, 152; Sailer, 54; Winckler, III, 56; Simrock, 2269<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Körte, 1295.</hi></p>                <lb/>
