<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Frz.</hi>: Battre et applanir l'aire.</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Aream exaequare cylindro. (<hi rendition="#i">Bovill, II, 5.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
