<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: Better a lean jade, than an empty halter. &#x2013; Better a mouse in the pot, than no flesh of all. &#x2013; Better some of the pudding than none of the pie. &#x2013; Better one small fish, than an empty dish. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 109.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
