<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*27 Hai blöst freu un drift lâte (spät).</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Driburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 362, 17.</hi></p>                <lb/>
