<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">138 Wenn ên Gôs Wâter süht, so will de anner drinken.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Mecklenburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Schiller, III, 10<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
