</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Gebirge.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*1 Et üs éner, wä e jeang Geberg.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Siebenbürg.-sächs.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 31, 1.</hi></p>                <lb/>
