<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">10 Das (böss) gerücht tödtet den mann.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, II, 19<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Tappius, 25<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Henisch, 1525, 26; Eyering, I, 280 u. 380; Petri, II, 60; Lehmann, II, 58, 19; Körte, 2046 u. 2520; Simrock, 3456; Braun, I, 742; Graf, 454, 456; Sailer, 183.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: He that has an ill name, is half hanged. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 118.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
