</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Gnädig.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">Gnädig, Herr Düvel, ück bin ôk 'n Gespök.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Ostfries.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 428, 490; Bueren, 484; Hauskalender, II.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Gnarrsack.</hi></head>                <lb/>
